The following information must be indicated in the joint application for the dissolution of marriage:
 surname, name, patronymic (if any), dare and place of birth, citizenship, place of residence of each martial partner;
 nationality, education, first or second marriage (entered at the request of each marital partner);
 reference details of the marriage entry,
 the surnames chosen by each of the marital partners at the dissolution of the marriage.

